WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:28.186
Benjamin and Peter walked through the woods.

2
00:00:28.187 --> 00:00:33.965
At last they saw a stone wall.

3
00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:42.421
"The farmer's garden!" said Peter.

4
00:00:42.422 --> 00:00:48.370
The two rabbits climbed onto the wall.

5
00:00:48.371 --> 00:00:51.586
Peter gasped.

6
00:00:51.587 --> 00:00:55.095
"Look at that scarecrow!

7
00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:59.713
It's wearing my jacket and shoes!"

8
00:00:59.714 --> 00:01:03.990
"Let's get them back!" said Benjamin.

9
00:01:03.991 --> 00:01:07.982
"I don't know," said Peter.

10
00:01:07.983 --> 00:01:13.331
"We'll be fine," said Benjamin.

11
00:01:13.332 --> 00:01:16.464
He grabbed a pear tree.

12
00:01:16.465 --> 00:01:23.269
Then he slid down into the garden.

13
00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:25.481
Peter followed.

14
00:01:25.482 --> 00:01:30.446
Benjamin and Peter ran to the scarecrow.

15
00:01:30.447 --> 00:01:34.952
Peter took his shoes off the scarecrow.

16
00:01:34.953 --> 00:01:38.299
Water poured out of them.

17
00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:47.380
"I guess it rained last night," he said.

18
00:01:47.381 --> 00:01:54.015
Peter took off the handkerchief.

19
00:01:54.016 --> 00:01:57.557
He put on his jacket.

20
00:01:57.558 --> 00:02:02.413
"My jacket shrank in the rain," he said.

21
00:02:02.414 --> 00:02:07.126
The scarecrow was also wearing a hat.

22
00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:11.247
Benjamin tried on the hat.

23
00:02:11.248 --> 00:02:14.932
"It's much too big," he said.

24
00:02:14.933 --> 00:02:21.458
"That's the farmer's hat," said Peter.

25
00:02:21.459 --> 00:02:25.405
He looked around nervously.

26
00:02:25.406 --> 00:02:29.550
"We should leave now," said Peter.

27
00:02:29.551 --> 00:02:33.370
"No," said Benjamin.

28
00:02:33.371 --> 00:02:41.532
"I want to get some onions!"
